  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>40</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy phải ghim hai cái đinh cách các mép tấm ván ép là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (cm).</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVà lấy vòng dây có độ dài là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (cm).</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/3dd67d51388adbc47a38c98861292e0562e5bea4be3498dbbcff1eb9cfbd5c76.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
